 result←object(State Poly)arg;tunits;props;points
 result←⍬
 ⍝ 'Poly' (n 2 ⍴ r c) ...

 '∆WI RANK ERROR: Poly'##.Error∨/2<≢¨⍴¨arg
 '∆WI LENGTH ERROR: Poly'##.Error∨/2≠≢¨⍴¨arg
 '∆WI LENGTH ERROR: Poly'##.Error∨/2≠⊢/¨⍴¨arg
 '∆WI LENGTH ERROR: Poly'##.Error∨/1=≢¨arg
 'DOMAIN ERROR'##.Error~∧/##.IsNum¨arg
 tunits←⊃##.Classes._supp.MyUnits State
 props←StartObj'Poly'
 props,←DefinePen State
 props,←DefineBrush State
 props,←⊂'DrawMode'(2⊃State._mode)

 :For points :In arg ⍝ Build one polygon set of lines at a time
     points←points×⍤1⊢tunits ⍝ Convert to pixels from object's scale
     State GUI props,⊂'Points'points
 :EndFor
